  "identity": "Hovering sovereign made of black iron slag over a broad molten-orange belly core. Huge squat pear-shaped armored mantle, FIVE blunt crown prongs of fused bronze, narrow haughty gold eyes, thick short floating gauntlets. Lower hem drips into a pointed slag skirt, no legs; bright cracks restrained to core and joints. Regal yet comically overheated, crown slightly off-center.",
  "definition_header": "name SLAG SOVEREIGN\ntext Fuel and tribute seal the forge throne until its supply officers are actually slain.\nby angelX\nwhere hellforge\nhp 820\nsize 1.7\nmove hover speed=1.0\nattack ring shots=6 speed=5 every=85 damage=12 shot=ember\nattack aimed shots=2 speed=7 every=60 damage=10 shot=ember\nphases twin_spiral sweep rain laser every=72 volleys=2 damage=12\nrage 30%\ndrops gold 180, gem 2",
